        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to retrieve 50 missing shopping carts and push them all back to their designated parking spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no easy job. You'll need plenty of patience, a sharp mind, and nimble hands to become a qualified shopping cart pusher, otherwise, I guarantee you'll never find all the carts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/367a617e298b894e8d20bbe5a0610020.poster.avif?t=1789222454\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/367a617e298b894e8d20bbe5a0610020.webm?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/367a617e298b894e8d20bbe5a0610020.mp4?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a physics-based simulation, your shopping carts will become uncontrollable due to impacts and inertia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the entire shopping mall, finding the missing carts in the parking lot, shops, supermarket, and even on the rooftop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use surrounding objects to discover hidden information in the environment to solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the shopping carts to earn money to unlock items and power-ups.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/643fc312213eacb05e4556c7935364d2.poster.avif?t=1789222454\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/643fc312213eacb05e4556c7935364d2.webm?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/643fc312213eacb05e4556c7935364d2.mp4?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prank your customers by knocking them down, stuffing them into your cart, and launching them away.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the shopping mall by grabbing nearby items and knocking down any mischievous customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various secrets hidden throughout the mall to uncover different hidden endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/4f60978123a01b3d88ddf26e0103e7a1.poster.avif?t=1789222454\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/4f60978123a01b3d88ddf26e0103e7a1.webm?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/4f60978123a01b3d88ddf26e0103e7a1.mp4?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to retrieve 50 missing shopping carts and push them all back to their designated parking spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no easy job. You'll need plenty of patience, a sharp mind, and nimble hands to become a qualified shopping cart pusher, otherwise, I guarantee you'll never find all the carts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/367a617e298b894e8d20bbe5a0610020.poster.avif?t=1789222454\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/367a617e298b894e8d20bbe5a0610020.webm?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/367a617e298b894e8d20bbe5a0610020.mp4?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a physics-based simulation, your shopping carts will become uncontrollable due to impacts and inertia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the entire shopping mall, finding the missing carts in the parking lot, shops, supermarket, and even on the rooftop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use surrounding objects to discover hidden information in the environment to solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the shopping carts to earn money to unlock items and power-ups.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/643fc312213eacb05e4556c7935364d2.poster.avif?t=1789222454\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/643fc312213eacb05e4556c7935364d2.webm?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/643fc312213eacb05e4556c7935364d2.mp4?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prank your customers by knocking them down, stuffing them into your cart, and launching them away.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the shopping mall by grabbing nearby items and knocking down any mischievous customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various secrets hidden throughout the mall to uncover different hidden endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/4f60978123a01b3d88ddf26e0103e7a1.poster.avif?t=1789222454\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/4f60978123a01b3d88ddf26e0103e7a1.webm?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/4f60978123a01b3d88ddf26e0103e7a1.mp4?t=1789222454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
